OL,3,GNEWSA'An #8k service charge left me
OL,4,Aunable to pay bills'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCuro, which says it does not make any
OL,7,Fmoney from the contributions, said it
OL,8,Fwas "trying to work with residents to
OL,9,Fprepare them for these bills".
